WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:18.003
Mark: Second grade is the best!

2
00:00:18.004 --> 00:00:23.185
Jenna and Daisy: Second grade is the worst!

3
00:00:23.186 --> 00:00:26.677
Mr. Joe: Good morning, boys and girls.

4
00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:29.210
Mr. Joe: Miss Gray is busy with something.

5
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:37.163
Mr. Joe: So I'm going to bring you to Room Two today.

6
00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:41.027
Coby: Hey, is that a maze?

7
00:00:41.028 --> 00:00:43.384
Mark: I think so.

8
00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:46.391
Mark: And look! There are mice!

9
00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:54.476
Jenna: Did somebody say mice? Real mice?

10
00:00:54.477 --> 00:00:59.050
Jim: Miss Gray, why are you wearing a stopwatch?

11
00:00:59.051 --> 00:01:02.337
Miss Gray: Because Room Two is going to the races, Jim.

12
00:01:02.338 --> 00:01:04.410
Class: What?

13
00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:07.487
Miss Gray: Today we're diving into math.

14
00:01:07.488 --> 00:01:10.830
Miss Gray: That means we're going to do a fun math activity.

15
00:01:10.831 --> 00:01:13.650
Jenna: The mice won't get hurt, will they?

16
00:01:13.651 --> 00:01:20.913
Miss Gray: Of course not. They're just going to race.

17
00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.484
Miss Gray: Each mouse will run through the maze.

18
00:01:23.485 --> 00:01:25.224
Miss Gray: We will time them.

19
00:01:25.225 --> 00:01:28.765
Miss Gray: Then we'll use math to see which one is faster.

20
00:01:28.766 --> 00:01:31.146
Mark: Mouse math!

21
00:01:31.147 --> 00:01:33.661
Miss Gray: On your mark, get set . . .

22
00:01:33.662 --> 00:01:45.339
Class: Go!

23
00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:47.555
Miss Gray: On your mark, get set . . .

24
00:01:47.556 --> 00:02:08.335
Class: Go!

25
00:02:08.336 --> 00:02:11.748
Miss Gray: Let’s use mouse math now to compare them.

26
00:02:11.749 --> 00:02:15.859
Mark: The black mouse took less time. So he won!

27
00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.733
Daisy: The white mouse took twice as long.

28
00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:22.141
So she lost.

29
00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:29.225
Miss Gray: Good!

30
00:02:29.226 --> 00:02:32.086
Jenna: They're cute.

31
00:02:32.087 --> 00:02:33.872
Jenna: Do they have names?

32
00:02:33.873 --> 00:02:39.012
Miss Gray: That's Jill. And this is . . . Bill.

33
00:02:39.013 --> 00:02:42.244
Jenna: Hey, that rhymes!

34
00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:46.208
Miss Gray: Of course. I love rhyming words.

35
00:02:46.209 --> 00:02:49.625
Jenna: Miss Gray? Can I tell you something?

36
00:02:49.626 --> 00:02:51.831
Miss Gray: Sure, Jenna.

37
00:02:51.832 --> 00:02:54.291
Jenna: I love Room Two.

38
00:02:54.292 --> 00:02:59.278
I really do!
